      "description": "Successful purchases over paywalls shown.\n\n**Whole-funnel only.** `iap.purchase_result` does not carry the `trigger` that opened the paywall, so this cannot be split by moment — which is the question SPEC §14 actually asks of this board. Until the trigger rides on the purchase event, the panel below tells you which moment gets *offered* most, and this one tells you the blended rate. See `docs/practices/app-events.md`.",
